#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:2
msgid "Docker Registry"
msgstr "Docker Registry"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:7
msgid ""
"Without any additional configuration, |morpheus| can provision images "
"from Docker's public hub at https://hub.docker.com/ using their public "
"API."
msgstr "Sem qualquer configuração adicional, o |morpheus| pode provisionar imagens do hub público do Docker em https://hub.docker.com/ usando a API pública deles."

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:9
msgid ""
"However, many organizations maintain private Docker registries for "
"security measures. Additional public and private Docker registries can be"
" added to Morpheus."
msgstr "No entanto, muitas organizações mantêm registries Docker privados por medidas de segurança. Registries Docker públicos e privados adicionais podem ser adicionados ao Morpheus."

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:12
msgid "Adding a Docker Registry Integration"
msgstr "Adicionando uma Integração Docker Registry"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:14
msgid "Navigate to |AdmInt|"
msgstr "Navegue até |AdmInt|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:15
msgid "Click \"New Integration\""
msgstr "Clique em \"New Integration\""

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:16
msgid "Select the `Docker Repository` Type"
msgstr "Selecione o Tipo `Docker Repository`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:17
msgid "Add the following:"
msgstr "Adicione o seguinte:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:19
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nome"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:20
msgid "Name for the Registry in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Nome do Registry no |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:21
msgid "Repository url"
msgstr "Url do repositório"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:22
msgid "Docker Registry url or IP address"
msgstr "Url ou endereço IP do Docker Registry"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:23
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Nome do Usuário"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:24
msgid "Username if private registry"
msgstr "Nome do usuário se registry privado"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:25
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Senha"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:26
msgid "Password if private registry"
msgstr "Senha se registry privado"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:28
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Save Changes"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:30
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:30
msgid ""
"You must either have signed certificates for your registry or configure "
"your docker host(s) to accept insecure registries"
msgstr "Você deve ter certificados assinados para o seu registry ou configurar seu(s) host(s) docker para aceitar registries inseguros"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:33
msgid "Provisioning an Instance from Docker Registry"
msgstr "Provisionando uma Instância a partir do Docker Registry"

#: ../../integration_guides/Containers/docker_registry.rst:35
msgid ""
"Docker images from the Integrated Registry can be provisioned using the "
"generic `Docker` Instance Type, or by adding images to Node Types for "
"custom Library Instance Types."
msgstr "Imagens Docker do Registry Integrado podem ser provisionadas usando o Tipo de Instância genérico `Docker`, ou adicionando imagens a Node Types para Tipos de Instância personalizados da Biblioteca."

